</a>. Bench-top centrifuge capable of reaching speeds up to 14000 rpm and centrifugal forces of \(20800 \times g\). This particular centrifuge is refrigerated, allowing samples to be cooled to temperatures as low as &ndash;4<sup>o</sup>C.</figcaption>
